{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：10:30 2026-10-24 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\" 獨家丨Stanley邱士縉Alina李炘頤明日峇里結婚 姜濤素顏戴帽現身機場 禁區一見Tiger攬到實\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/40a1dda9c2e1a3b6dfac8d6fdb6ea84a/2026-10/Kf001_1.jpg\"/>\n<p>《星島頭條》早前獨家披露MIRROR首位人夫邱士縉（Stanley）於本月25日與太太李炘頤（Alina）在峇里島舉行婚禮，隊友Jeremy（李駿傑）、Jer（柳應廷）和Edan（呂爵安）出任兄弟團，新郎哥Stanley昨日在Anson Lo（盧瀚霆）和3位兄弟團掩護下，聲東擊西避過粉絲低調出發。</p>\n<p>今日（24日）《星島頭條》獨家直擊姜濤和Tiger（邱傲然）出發峇里，早上約於8時20分，姜濤乘座駕抵達機場，見他戴著黑色帽子和口罩，打扮隨意，在數名助手陪同下步行入內，沿途有數十粉絲到場送機，他們一見到偶像即大叫姜濤名字，但姜濤未有理會，全程雙手插袋，他在辦理好登機手續後就經保安閘口進入安檢禁區。此時身穿白衣的Tiger已身在禁區內，他見到閘外有粉絲都望了一望外面，而姜濤一見Tiger即開心又熱情地攬住他的膊頭，兩兄弟一起出發。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f8343da4690d7fff5edf95e9db5bef2/2026-10/018_3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8c997a85160ee73868b14fccd33bc17c/2026-10/017_4.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4c4b99d0b237396f67cf6bf6d843f253/2026-10/016_3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4bb45dea3e2e552d02983b053bc83c37/2026-10/015_9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ea50bd110b323ad9ecf29fa55a5b8d77/2026-10/014_9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e9980eb16de577da72b0585b725b3c70/2026-10/013_8.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e6734877951e3e06b1a421345fbe6343/2026-10/012_10.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9fd17c2443951653b72784354d831402/2026-10/011_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c85d44d074234f1fe16dfff89f6ef506/2026-10/010_0_16.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/72844f3999e14f04a49b833582176128/2026-10/009_1_5.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/28f296fee614973597e7693dd2691131/2026-10/07_3_9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f762d0d970f2f98f90b9e367c026ae71/2026-10/007_2_10.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4b974dcee176679343ff83a7a1de2340/2026-10/006_0_25.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3fb8efee7c4c11d5eb3ce6669c264ca4/2026-10/005_2_9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0a9c82386d1ed360afbbe11795ac196a/2026-10/004_2_13.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0fe199a7f142ecfee0a8211bfc06d59f/2026-10/003_2_17.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a014196d696dbe5a73d49f870a6c3091/2026-10/002_1_16.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b895e37899073166d5c3a32e902353d3/2026-10/001_1_15.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T02:44:13.784960+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":393,"images":19,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T02:30:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:29.332048+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:29.332048+00:00","content_hash":"f3e4db382399c3eed89184d9d2531fe29224847fb61f05785135041a33e76865","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}